---

<section id="about" class="py-24 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900/50 transition-colors duration-300">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">About Me</h2>
      <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-800"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
      <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          I'm a Senior Software Engineer with 7 years of experience building <span class="font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">Java</span> backend systems across <span class="font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">FinTech and AdTech</span> — domains where correctness, performance, and reliability aren't negotiable.
        </p>
        <p>
          My core stack is <span class="font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">Java 17 and Spring Boot</span>: micro-services and REST APIs, Spring Batch pipelines moving high volumes of data, Spring Security for auth and multi-tenancy, and Hibernate over PostgreSQL and Sybase. A lot of my best work has been performance work — finding the bottleneck nobody had profiled and cutting a critical pipeline from <span class="font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">60 minutes to 15</span>, or parallelising a serial import with an <span class="font-mono text-sm">ExecutorService</span> so it handles 10,000 records in one pass.
        </p>
        <p>
          That work has taken me from core trading and reporting systems at a global investment bank, to analytics dashboards for a Fortune 500 payment card provider, to high-volume campaign pipelines at <span class="text-[#1668d4] font-medium">Mediaocean</span> — where I own features end-to-end on the Prisma advertising platform, serving clients like Disney. I care as much about the architecture as the implementation: I've authored HLD and LLD for platforms pitched to clients, and I own delivery from requirement analysis through to production.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm comfortable across the stack — React and TypeScript, including a Single-SPA micro-frontend — but backend is where I go deep. Outside of work I build open-source tools, mentor developers and review their code, run internal tech sessions, and stay sharp on <span class="font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">Google Cloud Platform</span> (certified Professional Cloud Developer, 2025).
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats / Quick facts -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1668d4]">7</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Years in Java Backend</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1668d4]">~85%</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Peak Pipeline Latency Cut</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1668d4]">3</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Companies Shipped At</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1668d4]">GCP</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Certified Cloud Dev</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Certifications -->
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-3 mt-2">Certifications</h3>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            <a
              href="https://www.credly.com/badges/52aa0a6a-cd69-48a3-a306-eee5504fe644/linked_in_profile"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/30 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-900 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 text-sm font-medium hover:border-[#2580ff] transition-colors"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22.56 12.25c0-.78-.07-1.53-.2-2.25H12v4.26h5.92c-.26 1.37-1.04 2.53-2.21 3.31v2.77h3.57c2.08-1.92 3.28-4.74 3.28-8.09z"/><path d="M12 23c2.97 0 5.46-.98 7.28-2.66l-3.57-2.77c-.98.66-2.23 1.06-3.71 1.06-2.86 0-5.29-1.93-6.16-4.53H2.18v2.84C3.99 20.53 7.7 23 12 23z"/><path d="M5.84 14.09c-.22-.66-.35-1.36-.35-2.09s.13-1.43.35-2.09V7.07H2.18C1.43 8.55 1 10.22 1 12s.43 3.45 1.18 4.93l2.85-2.22.81-.62z"/><path d="M12 5.38c1.62 0 3.06.56 4.21 1.64l3.15-3.15C17.45 2.09 14.97 1 12 1 7.7 1 3.99 3.47 2.18 7.07l3.66 2.84c.87-2.6 3.3-4.53 6.16-4.53z"/></svg>
